orbitra-dev-lobby-connect = Direct connect + lobby
orbitra-dev-lobby-tooltip = Start a local Dev server with a lobby on port 1214 and connect. The server closes with this client.
orbitra-dev-lobby-starting = Preparing dev lobby…
orbitra-dev-lobby-build-failed = Could not prepare a compatible server. Rebuild the client and check bin/Orbitra.DevServer/build.log and build-errors.log.
orbitra-dev-lobby-port-busy = Port 1214 is occupied by another server. It will not be restarted; free the port or use direct connect.
orbitra-dev-lobby-no-server = Local server build not found. Build Content.Server and run the dev client from the Orbitra repository.
orbitra-dev-lobby-start-failed = Could not start the local lobby server. Check the .NET installation and server log.
orbitra-dev-lobby-timeout = The lobby server did not start in time. Check its log and try again.
